ERROR:  unexpected end of input in anyquery
LINE 1: SELECT ''::anyquery;
               ^
SELECT '1 &'::anyquery;
ERROR:  unexpected end of input in anyquery
LINE 1: SELECT '1 &'::anyquery;
               ^
SELECT '1 & (2'::anyquery;
ERROR:  missing closing parenthesis in anyquery
LINE 1: SELECT '1 & (2'::anyquery;
               ^
SELECT '1 ) 2'::anyquery;
